post.description:
Process multiple images from a document in batch

This endpoint processes entire documents asynchronously, running
multiple operations on each page/image.

Example:
    POST /askara/batch-process
    {
        "document_id": "doc_123",
        "images": [
            {
                "url": "http://192.168.0.250:8080/documents/page1.jpg",
                "operations": ["ocr", "caption"]
            },
            {
                "url": "http://192.168.0.250:8080/documents/page2.jpg",
                "operations": ["ocr"]
            }
        ],
        "callback_url": "http://192.168.0.250:8080/ml-results"
    }

Import cluster configuration from JSON.

Example:
    POST /cluster/config/import
    {
        "partners": [
            {"host": "192.168.0.251", "port": 6161, "name": "Worker 2"},
            {"host": "192.168.0.252", "port": 6161, "name": "Worker 3"}
        ]
    }
